    <bpmn:process id="W_W4780" name="W4780. Solar/Storage Integration &amp; Behind-the-Meter Energy Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site with own solar/storage (VS-108); peak-shaving strategy (W4775)
Frequency: Per site + continuous optimization
Volume: ~40–80 sites co-located with BuildRight solar/storage (the rooftop-solar subset of ~205 sites per VS-108)
Owner: EV Program Manager / Energy (VS-108)
Participants: Renewable ops (VS-108), Facilities (VS-138), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4780 — Solar/Storage Integration &amp; Behind-the-Meter Energy Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4780_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4780_Lane1" name="Renewable Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4780_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4780_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4780_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4780_Lane2" name="Energy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4780_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4780_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4780_Start4" name="Site with own solar/storage (VS-108); peak-shaving strategy (W4775)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4780_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4780_Task5" name="Integrate the charging load behind-the-meter with BuildRight&#x27;s own solar PV +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Integrate the charging load behind-the-meter with BuildRight&#x27;s own solar PV + battery storage (VS-108): direct solar-to-EV charging (greenest, lowest cost), storage peak-shaving to avoid demand-charges (W4775), and load-balancing across the store + EVSE + storage via the energy management system (EMS)
Responsible (R): Renewable Ops / Energy / Facilities
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager
Duration: Per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4780_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4780_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4780_Task6" name="Coordinate energy dispatch: prioritize solar to EVSE when generation is high…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Coordinate energy dispatch: prioritize solar to EVSE when generation is high, discharge storage during peak to shave demand, charge storage off-peak, and manage the trade-off between selling/exporting (net-metering VS-108) vs self-consuming for EV revenue; optimize for cost + decarbonization
Responsible (R): Renewable Ops / Energy / Finance
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4780_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4780_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4780_Task7" name="Account for the green-energy attribute: attribute renewable kWh to EV charging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account for the green-energy attribute: attribute renewable kWh to EV charging for ESG/decarbonization reporting (VS-25 Scope 2/3) and &quot;100% renewable charging&quot; marketing (VS-14); verify via the REC/metering (VS-108); feed to analytics (W4792)
Responsible (R): Energy / ESG / Marketing
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / ESG Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4780_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4780_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4780_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4780_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-720 (ensure controlled execution — Station Deployment, Energy Integration &amp; Roaming/Payment (PA-163.2).) | - CTL-720: EMS balances store + EVSE + storage; demand-charge managed; renewable kWh attributed once (ESG VS-25)
Owner: EV Program Manager / Energy (VS-108)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4780_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4780_Annotation9" targetRef="W4780_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
