    <bpmn:process id="W_W4781" name="W4781. CSMS Backend, OCPP Configuration &amp; Network Commissioning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: EVSE installation (W4778); own-operate or CPO backend
Frequency: Per site + continuous platform ops
Volume: ~all networked charge points
Owner: EV Program Manager / IT (VS-27) / Cyber (VS-27.3)
Participants: CSMS vendor/CPO, IT (VS-27), Cyber (VS-27.3), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4781 — CSMS Backend, OCPP Configuration &amp; Network Commissioning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4781_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4781_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4781_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4781_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4781_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4781_Lane2" name="Privacy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4781_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4781_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4781_Start4" name="EVSE installation (W4778); own-operate or CPO backend">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4781_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4781_Task5" name="Deploy/configure the Charging Station Management System (CSMS): OCPP 1.6/2.0.1…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Deploy/configure the Charging Station Management System (CSMS): OCPP 1.6/2.0.1 backend connectivity, charger provisioning, firmware management, remote diagnostics/start-stop, real-time status (available/charging/faulted), and the operations dashboard (uptime, sessions, faults); integrate to BuildRight IT (VS-27) and the app (VS-75)
Responsible (R): IT / CSMS vendor / EV Program
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / IT
Duration: Per site + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4781_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4781_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4781_Task6" name="Configure the customer-facing platform: charger discovery/reservation (app…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Configure the customer-facing platform: charger discovery/reservation (app VS-75), session start/stop (W4783), tariff/billing (W4775/W4783), notifications (charge-complete, idle-fee), and the roaming interface (OCPI W4782); manage cybersecurity (VS-27.3) — OCPP security profile, certificates, network segmentation, and the IoT attack-surface hardening
Responsible (R): IT / Cyber / App team / EV Program
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / CIO
Duration: Per site + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4781_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4781_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4781_Task7" name="Govern the data: charging-session data is personal/transactional (driver ID…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern the data: charging-session data is personal/transactional (driver ID, payment) — classify (VS-91), secure (VS-27.3), retain per policy (VS-88), and feed to analytics (W4792) and loyalty (VS-13); manage the CSMS vendor as a TPRM/IoT risk (VS-161)
Responsible (R): Privacy / Cyber / IT / EV Program
Accountable (A): DPO / EV Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4781_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4781_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4781_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4781_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-720 (ensure controlled execution — Station Deployment, Energy Integration &amp; Roaming/Payment (PA-163.2).) | - CTL-720: OCPP security profile + network segmentation; session data classified/secured (VS-91/VS-27.3); CSMS vendor under TPRM (VS-161)
Owner: EV Program Manager / IT (VS-27) / Cyber (VS-27.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
