    <bpmn:process id="W_W4783" name="W4783. Payment, Access (RFID/App/QR) &amp; Loyalty/Promotion Activation at the Charger" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Driver initiates a charge (per session)
Frequency: Per charging session
Volume: ~2,000–6,000 sessions/month at scale (~400–1,200 ports at early-utilization rates)
Owner: EV Program Manager / Payment Ops (VS-80)
Participants: Driver, Payment/Acquirer (VS-80), Loyalty (VS-13), App (VS-75)
Source: workflow W4783 — Payment, Access (RFID/App/QR) &amp; Loyalty/Promotion Activation at the Charger</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4783_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4783_Lane1" name="Payment Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4783_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4783_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4783_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4783_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4783_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4783_Start3" name="Driver initiates a charge (per session)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4783_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4783_Task4" name="Manage the session-start access methods: BuildRight app/QR (VS-75), RFID card…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage the session-start access methods: BuildRight app/QR (VS-75), RFID card, contactless payment (card/phone tap per VS-80), or roaming eMSP card; pre-authorize payment (VS-80) or validate subscription/loyalty (VS-13); start the session via CSMS (W4781)
Responsible (R): Payment Ops / IT / EV Program
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager
Duration: Per session</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4783_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4783_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4783_Task5" name="Apply the tariff (W4775), loyalty/promotion (VS-13/W4773), and dwell-offer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply the tariff (W4775), loyalty/promotion (VS-13/W4773), and dwell-offer during the session; capture metering (kWh, time) for billing (VS-115 calibrated); send charge-complete and idle-fee notifications (VS-75)
Responsible (R): Payment Ops / Loyalty / EV Program
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager
Duration: Per session</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4783_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4783_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4783_Task6" name="Settle the session: compute the charge (kWh tariff + time + idle-fee − loyalty…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Settle the session: compute the charge (kWh tariff + time + idle-fee − loyalty discount), capture payment (VS-80), issue the BIR-compliant e-invoice/receipt (VS-79 W473), post revenue (VS-17/VS-157), accrue loyalty points (VS-13), and reconcile (W4792)
Responsible (R): Payment Ops / Finance / Loyalty
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager / Finance
Duration: Per session</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4783_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4783_End7" name="Complete">
