      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4783_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-720 (ensure controlled execution — Station Deployment, Energy Integration &amp; Roaming/Payment (PA-163.2).) | - CTL-720: payment pre-authorized or loyalty/subscription validated before start; metering calibrated (VS-115); BIR e-invoice issued; revenue reconciled
Owner: EV Program Manager / Payment Ops (VS-80)</bpmn:text>
